}, "天马在现有“仪表盘”中内嵌 AI 运营看板区域。观远 BI 看板上线前展示建设中占位状态，上线后通过安全嵌入方式展示观远页面。该区域仅超级管理员可见。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001470", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户角色与用户故事"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001471", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "作为超级管理员，我希望按部门、模式和智能体判断产品是否被使用，并在必要时下钻到原始会话。天马只提供数据和安全入口，不重复开发 BI 图表。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001472", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "业务主流程图及说明"]]], ["code", {"syntax": "mermaid", "theme": "default", "uuid": "u001473", "code": "flowchart TD\n    A[用户消息与AI回答完成] --> B{是否构成有效对话轮次}\n    B -->|否| C[记录失败原因但不计入有效轮次]\n    B -->|是| D[保存用户/部门/模式/智能体等统计维度]\n    D --> E[每小时生成运营指标与受限会话明细]\n    E --> F{数据集更新是否成功}\n    F -->|否| G[保留上次成功数据并自动重试]\n    F -->|是| H[记录最近成功时间]\n    G --> H\n    H --> I{观远看板是否已上线}\n    I -->|否| J[仪表盘展示建设中占位]\n    I -->|是| K[观远读取最新成功数据]\n    K --> L[超级管理员在仪表盘内嵌查看]"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "flowchart TD\n    A[用户消息与AI回答完成] --> B{是否构成有效对话轮次}\n    B -->|否| C[记录失败原因但不计入有效轮次]\n    B -->|是| D[保存用户/部门/模式/智能体等统计维度]\n    D --> E[每小时生成运营指标与受限会话明细]\n    E --> F{数据集更新是否成功}\n    F -->|否| G[保留上次成功数据并自动重试]\n    F -->|是| H[记录最近成功时间]\n    G --> H\n    H --> I{观远看板是否已上线}\n    I -->|否| J[仪表盘展示建设中占位]\n    I -->|是| K[观远读取最新成功数据]\n    K --> L[超级管理员在仪表盘内嵌查看]"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001475", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001474", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "有效对话产生并保存统计维度。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001476", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001474", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "每小时汇总发生或变化的数据，更新两套数据集。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001477", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001474", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "记录最近一次成功时间，观远读取最新成功数据。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001478", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001474", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listSty