ii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "接口说明"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001955", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "不在产品需求阶段定义具体接口；实现需保证建议生成异步执行，并在返回时校验会话 ID 与回答消息 ID。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001956", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "AI 链路说明"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001957", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "AI 回答完成后，系统异步读取当前会话上下文并调用“追问建议生成”提示词。结果返回时校验会话 ID、回答消息 ID 与建议数量。校验通过后展示建议气泡，生成失败、结果迟到或数量不足时静默丢弃，不影响主回答。用户点击建议后，建议文本作为用户消息进入现有费用预估、额度校验和回答链路。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001958", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt", "bold": true}, "系统提示词初稿"]]], ["code", {"syntax": "text", "theme": "default", "uuid": "u001959", "code": "你是天马智擎的“下一步问题建议器”。请根据用户当前问题、最近会话上下文和最新一条 AI 回答，生成 3 条用户最可能继续追问的问题。\n\n要求：\n1. 每条建议必须能直接作为用户消息发送，不要使用“你可以问”等引导语。\n2. 三条建议应分别侧重：继续深化、形成行动、补充核验；避免语义重复。\n3. 每条不超过 30 个汉字，表达具体、自然、可执行。\n4. 不新增上下文中不存在的人员、数据、权限或事实。\n5. 不引用用户无权访问的知识，不要求绕过权限，不输出敏感信息。\n6. 如果上下文不足以生成 3 条高质量建议，返回空数组。\n7. 只输出 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或解释。\n\n输出格式：\n{\"suggestions\":[\"建议1\",\"建议2\",\"建议3\"]}"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "你是天马智擎的“下一步问题建议器”。请根据用户当前问题、最近会话上下文和最新一条 AI 回答，生成 3 条用户最可能继续追问的问题。\n\n要求：\n1. 每条建议必须能直接作为用户消息发送，不要使用“你可以问”等引导语。\n2. 三条建议应分别侧重：继续深化、形成行动、补充核验；避免语义重复。\n3. 每条不超过 30 个汉字，表达具体、自然、可执行。\n4. 不新增上下文中不存在的人员、数据、权限或事实。\n5. 不引用用户无权访问的知识，不要求绕过权限，不输出敏感信息。\n6. 如果上下文不足以生成 3 条高质量建议，返回空数组。\n7. 只输出 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或解释。\n\n输出格式：\n{\"suggestions\":[\"建议1\",\"建议2\",\"建议3\"]}"]]], ["h3", {"uuid": "u001960", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 2, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 2}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 14.5, "szUnit": "pt"}, "M6-快捷提示语"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001961", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "功能需求描述"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001962", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "在输入框下方、系统常用卡片上方新增“快捷提示语”区域。日常办公模式和每个专家均支持用户创建、编辑、删除各自的快捷提示语；提示语按用户与模式/专家隔离。选择后将正文填入当前输入框，用户可继续修改并主动发送。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001963", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "该能力用于复用用户预先保存的固定表达，与 M5“上下文主动建议”相互独立：快捷提示语由用户维护、发送前使用；上下文建议由系统根据最新回答生成，点击后直接发送。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001964", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户角色与用户故事"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001965", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "作为对话用户，我希望保存经常使用的提示语，并能在任意会话的输入框中快速调用，避免反复输入相同内容。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001966", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"id": "3", "level": 3}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "color": "#000000", "bold": true, "sz": 13, "szUnit": "pt"}, "业务主流程图及说明"]]], ["code", {"syntax": "mermaid", "theme": "default", "uuid": "u001967", "code": "flowchart TD\n    A[进入日常办公或某个专家] --> B[读取当前用户在当前范围的快捷提示语]\n    B --> C{是否已有提示语}\n    C -->|否| D[展示空态与新建入口]\n    C -->|是| E[在输入框下方展示快捷提示语]\n    D --> F[填写名称/正文]\n    E --> G{用户操作}\n    G -->|选择提示语| H[在当前光标位置插入正文]\n    G -->|新建或编辑| F\n    G -->|删除| I[二次确认后删除]\n    F --> J{数量与字段校验是否通过}\n    J -->|否| K[保留内容并提示限制]\n    J -->|是| E\n    H --> L[用户继续编辑]\n    L --> M{是否主动发送}\n    M -->|否| N[不调用模型且不计费]\n    M -->|是| O[进入现有对话与计费流程]"}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf"}, "flowchart TD\n    A[进入日常办公或某个专家] --> B[读取当前用户在当前范围的快捷提示语]\n    B --> C{是否已有提示语}\n    C -->|否| D[展示空态与新建入口]\n    C -->|是| E[在输入框下方展示快捷提示语]\n    D --> F[填写名称/正文]\n    E --> G{用户操作}\n    G -->|选择提示语| H[在当前光标位置插入正文]\n    G -->|新建或编辑| F\n    G -->|删除| I[二次确认后删除]\n    F --> J{数量与字段校验是否通过}\n    J -->|否| K[保留内容并提示限制]\n    J -->|是| E\n    H --> L[用户继续编辑]\n    L --> M{是否主动发送}\n    M -->|否| N[不调用模型且不计费]\n    M -->|是| O[进入现有对话与计费流程]"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001969", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001968", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户进入日常办公模式或选择某个专家后，系统读取当前用户在当前模式/专家范围内保存的提示语。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001970", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001968", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "快捷提示语展示在输入框下方、系统常用卡片上方，并提供管理入口。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001971", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001968", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户选择一条提示语，系统关闭选择面板并将正文填入输入框。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001972", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001968", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户可修改、补充或清空内容；只有用户主动点击发送后，才进入现有费用预估、额度校验和对话流程。"]]], ["p", {"uuid": "u001973", "spacing": {"line": 1.0, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "list-u001968", "isOrdered": true, "level": 0, "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1."}}}, ["span", {"data-type": "text"}, ["span", {"data-type": "leaf", "fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}, "sz": 12, "szUnit": "pt"}, "用户也可新建提示语，填写名称、非必填分类和提示语正文，保存成功后立即出现在对应分类中。"]]], ["h4", {"uuid": "u001974", "rPr": {"fonts": {"ascii": "微软雅黑", "cs": "Arial", "eastAsia": "微软雅黑", "hAnsi": "微软雅黑", "hint": "eastAsia"}}, "spacing": {"before": "10pt", "line": 1.5, "lineRule": "auto"}, "list": {"listId": "prd-heading-list", "level": 3, "listStyleType": "DEC_DEC_DEC_P", "listStyle": {"format": "decimal", "text": "%1.%2.%3.%4", "align": "left"}, "isOrdered": true, "autoLevel": true}, "numPr": {"i